        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 8SB, Heavy Duty Solid Brass 8\" Surface Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDecorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in an array of different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 8 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-8SB.gif?v=1704354531\" width=\"600\" height=\"270\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 8SB 8 Inch Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-6sb\"><b>Deltana 6SB 6\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-12sb\"><b>Deltana 12SB 12\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-18-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-18sb\"><b>Deltana 18SB 18\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-24-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-24sb\"><b>Deltana 24SB 24\" Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 8SB 8 Inch Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Width of Guides: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Includes 3 Strikes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/8SB.pdf?v=1691095268\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 8SB 8\" Surface Bolts Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 8 Inch Surface Bolt",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass 8 Inch Surface Slide Bolt, Deltana 8SB - Decorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in an array of different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 8 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-8SB 8 Inch Surface Bolts, deltana  surface bolts, decorative door bolts, surface mounted door bolts, bolt deltana 8SB  surface bolts heavy duty solid brass, 8 inch door bolt, deltana 8 inch Surface Bolts, 8 inches Surface Bolts, door slide bolts, 8 inch slidebolts, DEL-8SB15, DEL-8SB15A, DEL-8SB19, DEL-8SB10B, DEL-8SB26, DEL-8SB26D, DEL-8SB3, DEL-8SB5, DEL-8SB3-UNL, DEL-8SB003,"
